# .env.example — copy to .env, fill in what you use, keep it private:
#   cp .env.example .env && chmod 600 .env
# The real .env is gitignored (it holds secrets); this example is the committed template.

# --- OPTIONAL, OFF BY DEFAULT: image generation (/nano-banana-flash, /nano-banana-pro)
# This is the ONE third-party egress path in the seed: enabling it sends image prompts to
# Google's Gemini API. Leave it blank unless you explicitly want that trade.
# Key (free tier): https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
